":"行きたい神社もお寺もいっぱいあるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家から出ないせいで遠くにはいけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引きこもり、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/79e/a66d23d03ec33d27cca75eb1abf99-02.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母性観に行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり本も読んでいて、ずっと待ち望んでいた映画です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深く胸に沈む感じはしばらく心に影響を受けたけど、それが私は大っ好きだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せと不幸をどっちも吸収して劇場から出てきたときのあの感じも大っ好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技も映像も音楽も、没頭してたら一瞬で終わっちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなことに浸るのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にしたい時間だし忘れちゃいけない時間ですねぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近特に思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/79e/a66d23d03ec33d27cca75eb1abf99-03.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近DARSのチョコレートで冷蔵庫が潤ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"糖分大事だから見つけたらちょこちょこ買って補充してる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装もチョコレートみたいで素敵です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム甘さ控えめミルク、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山下さん梅澤さん久保さんとご一緒でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきな3期生さんです。しあわせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"